<div class="ct-container" style="padding: 40px 24px 70px;">
  <div style="font-family: inherit; color: #1e293b; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <h1 style="color: #0D529C; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 16px;">Pediatric Hearing Care: Nurturing Speech &amp; Language</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #475569;">
      Hearing is the biological cornerstone of spoken language, social learning, and intellectual development. A child learns speech by listening to their parents and surroundings from the earliest months of infancy.
    </p>

    <div style="background: #fffbeb; border: 1px solid #fef3c7; padding: 22px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 24px 0;">
      <h2 style="color: #b45309; margin-top: 0; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700;">Why Early Pediatric Intervention Matters</h2>
      <p style="color: #78350f; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 15px;">
        If hearing loss is left undiagnosed in infants, speech milestones are severely delayed. With early diagnosis via newborn OAE/BERA screening and timely fitting of pediatric hearing devices (such as Phonak Sky), children can learn, attend mainstream schools, and communicate with complete confidence.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2 style="color: #0D529C; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 28px;">Key Features of Pediatric Hearing Aids</h2>
    <ul style="padding-left: 20px; color: #334155; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8;">
      <li><strong>Tamperproof Battery Drawers:</strong> Prevents curious infants and toddlers from opening the battery compartment.</li>
      <li><strong>Robust Water &amp; Dust Resistance:</strong> Rated IP68 to withstand play, sweat, and unpredictable outdoor conditions.</li>
      <li><strong>Visual Indicator Lights:</strong> Reassures parents and teachers that the device is powered and functioning.</li>
      <li><strong>Roger Wireless FM Compatibility:</strong> Direct streaming from the classroom teacher’s wireless microphone straight to the child’s hearing aids.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

